1|0@researchchemicals^1440100362#cu9ukhs:chickenskittles$:3-MMC is the closest I guess but is not very serotonergic, and thus less rushy and euphoric. It's a great drug on its own right, but I found it way too hard on the body after a while, to a point where I will never touch it again. Butylone + methylone is a nice combo taken orally though. Butylone is dirty as fuck on its own. 4-EMC isn't bad. Very serotonergic but lacking in the DA and NE push. I don't think I would do it again unless it were free. 4-FMC was vaguely coke-like, but I think I might have had it mixed with 3,4-DMMC. Would not repeat, however. Pentedrone is a rather boring straight stimulant, seems to be an NDRI rather than the potent releaser that we know and love (mephedrone). Methedrone is potentially quite dangerous due to the chemical structure. I think some deaths had been reported. 2-MMC is meant to be a straight stimulant. Buphedrone is also nothing like meph. Quite frankly none of these are like meph except 3-MMC and 4-EMC and not very much so at that. 
